      "message": "Which is in line with the comment?  The comment (after \"For TEE KeyMint:\") is the original before I changed anything.\n\nNote that this is an [optional feature](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:system/keymint/README.md;l\u003d182;drc\u003debc8afa57fb4fb3a77d709e77f3e18222404af89\n) in the TEE KM reference implementation in Rust.  TEE vendors need to implement the `SecureDeletionSecretManager` trait, and even so, it only works if the OEM provides the RPMB (IIUC).",
